          "url": "https://crawlbase.com/cloud-storage-for-crawling-and-scraping",
          "description": "A programmatic storage and retrieval layer for scraping workflows, enabling persistence of scraped results, access to stored records, and bulk operations via API for scalable data pipelines and AI-ready applications. Free tier available."
        }
